    651  f062							; --- Cave COLUBK for this frame → written DIRECTLY (Phase 3) ---
    652  f062							; state=2: blink (60-BombTimer)&3 → black/yellow/red/yellow; else COLOR_CAVE_BG
    653  f062							; Dark room: black except the existing explosion blink (state=2).
    654  f062							; Phase 3: .Row no longer re-stores Temp→COLUBK per band (the slot now
    655  f062							; holds the BandTab ENABL gate), so this store IS the cave's COLUBK.
    656  f062							; Temp is free here onward for the staged BallX (bank2 StageBandTab) —
    657  f062							; no reader between this point and overscan's own `sta Temp` (joystick).
