    791  f0ce							; the band-0 .Row setup WSYNC gap is ~75c — so the kernel start line
    792  f0ce							; oscillated ±1 with the tick phase (measured: first .Line WSYNC at scn
    793  f0ce							; 20 on 100 frames, scn 21 on 51 frames under bomb/thrust input = the
    794  f0ce							; whole-screen jitter, HUD seam flipping rows 144/194). The re-anchor
    795  f0ce							; below (VBLANK still on = blank line) absorbs the quantization: the
    796  f0ce							; kernel + HUD are now WSYNC-line-locked every frame. +1 line/frame
    797  f0ce							; (blank, invisible); wall-model target moves 264 -> 265.
    798  f0ce		       85 02		      sta	WSYNC
