    866  f0ef							; after the door test (-4c, -7 B); A is still
    867  f0ef							; the colour, so store it into COLUP1 too.
    868  f0ef							; ENABL/PF2 shift 4c earlier (PF2 still well
    869  f0ef							; past x449).
    870  f0ef
    871  f0ef							; --- Per-band ball gate (Phase 3): BandTab[row] $ff/$00 → ENABL ---
    872  f0ef							; Takes the slot of the per-band `lda Temp / sta COLUBK` (VBL writes
    873  f0ef							; COLUBK once now) — same position, +1c (7c gate vs 6c pair), PF2 shifts
    874  f0ef							; c61→c62 (later = right half keeps OLD band even longer, thin-yellow fix
    875  f0ef							; intact). TIA latches ENABL per line: set on this setup line → ball on
    876  f0ef							; from the band's first body line; water + HUD inherit row2's value
    877  f0ef							; (.AfterRows clears ENABL before the HUD band; the HUD bar enables
    878  f0ef							; its own ball).
