   2419  f752							; frame can draw TWO objects (band pairing, or the 1-of-2 rotation). Driving
   2420  f752							; it from the ACTIVE object made the mirrored miner flip sides every other
   2421  f752							; frame in any room that also had another object. The miner's mirror is
   2422  f752							; gone (a design-based mirror like the LAMP's type 13 needs 32 more art
   2423  f752							; bytes and the table ends 6 B below the $F8C0 pin), so every GRP1 object
   2424  f752							; is drawn unmirrored and REFP1 stays 0 — the bank1 HUD writes 0 for its
   2425  f752							; score, which is exactly what the cave wants.
