   2761  f8c6							; YToRowTable — convert scanline to band row (0-3, N=4), idx A>>2
   2762  f8c6							; ==============================================================================
   2763  f8c6							; The jsr wrapper that used to live here was dead (PlayerHitsMap inlines the
   2764  f8c6							; lsr/lsr/tay/lda lookup — saves 2 JSR stack push levels to keep SP >= $F8)
   2765  f8c6							; and was removed in S1.6. Table rationale: the old subtract loop grew
   2766  f8c6							; linearly with RoomY and made 3× PlayerHitsMap (fall 2 + L/R 1) exceed
   2767  f8c6							; overscan TIM64T=35 (~2240c) in 4-rect rooms → frame >262 lines → vertical
   2768  f8c6							; roll when strafing while falling.
   2769  f8c6							; Indexed by A>>2: 37 entries (idx 0-35 = A 0-143 = the player envelope
   2770  f8c6							; "Max A = PLAYER_MAX_Y+11 = 143", + idx36 = the tentacle-bob clamp, below).
   2771  f8c6							; Costs +4c/call vs the 192-entry table, saves 144 ROM bytes.
   2772  f8c6							; Row = idx/9 = scanline/36 (N=4 cave bands of 36 lines = rows 0-3).
   2773  f8c6							;
   2774  f8c6							; 36 entries: 9 each of 0,1,2,3 + idx36 = 3: tentacle RoomY 133/134 (bob on
   2775  f8c6							; spawn y=132) → A=(Y+11)>>2 = 36 — WITHOUT this byte the lookup reads the
   2776  f8c6							; OOB opcode ($A5 = `lda RoomY`) → CollisionEndY garbage → cell walk
   2777  f8c6							; false-hits ~24/32 bob frames → measured 0.125 px/f vs the &1 gate's 0.5
   2778  f8c6							; (bugs.md #13). Clamped value 3 = last cave band (idx36 = lines 144-147,
   2779  f8c6							; past the cave) so the box bottom walks the bottom band, never PF0Buf+4
   2780  f8c6							; (out of the 4-byte buffer). Player never reaches idx36 (PLAYER_MAX_Y=122).
   2781  f8c6				   YToRowTable
   2782  f8c6		       00 00 00 00*	      .byte.b	0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0
   2783  f8cf		       01 01 01 01*	      .byte.b	1,1,1,1,1,1,1,1,1
   2784  f8d8		       02 02 02 02*	      .byte.b	2,2,2,2,2,2,2,2,2
   2785  f8e1		       03 03 03 03*	      .byte.b	3,3,3,3,3,3,3,3,3
   2786  f8ea		       03		      .byte.b	3	; idx36 — tentacle bob clamp (see above)
   2787  f8eb
