   4004  fdde							;   A = boots apart (stride, rows 10-11 spread to cols 2+6 / 1+6)
   4005  fdde							;   B = boots together (passing pose, rows 10-11 = cols 3+4)
   4006  fdde							; Legs rows 7-9 identical in both — only the boots move. Standing forces
   4007  fdde							; PlayerSpriteA; walk cycle alternates A<->B every 8 frames (EnemyRamP&$08,
   4008  fdde							; 16-frame full cycle) while grounded + L/R held.
